<title>USA: Times Mirror March advertising revs rise.</title>
<headline>Times Mirror March advertising revs rise.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Times Mirror Co Wednesday said advertising revenues for Times Mirror's Newspaper Publishing Group for the four weeks ended March 30, 1997, increased 1.9 percent to $123,866,000 from $121,509,000 in the prior year.</p>
<p>For the 13 weeks ended March 30, total advertising revenues rose 5.8 percent to $391,203,000 compared with $369,924,000 a year ago. The results for 1997 contained two fewer days than the 1996 results.</p>
